   "reason": "Seeded at the size it was found. An audit measured that 36 of 59 records cite no evidence file, and nothing in the ledger said so — the schema permits a record whose readings live only in its own `observations` array, and that permission had no ceiling. These 36 are grandfathered because retro-fitting captured output to readings taken months ago would mean inventing artefacts, which is the opposite of what this directory is for. New records must cite. The set may only shrink, and upgrading a record's `schema` must not close it: this is a different gap from schema_v1_records and is counted separately for that reason."
